{
  "schema": "lean-proof-simplification-evidence-v1",
  "source_commit": "75c50fe733e02de0a28e9913694864ea9127c64d",
  "source_parent": "45c7024dbdf294d7c8b00a7a53b83fe7a6bd15b3",
  "scope": "Remove four private positive-to-one wrappers and use existing equivalent lemma",
  "validation": "Six refreshed source-pinned Pell upstream builds and 26 selected paired target/client builds pass. The original 13-module refreshed lanes and separate six-module current-source BinomExpansion replays are retained. Exact adopted Pow and Pow-built BinomExpansion objects are pinned; all five direct module clients and nine unchanged downstream objects match. Six-object-pinned combined census shows 46 equal common type/axiom reports, four private removals, no additions and matching global simp/instance lists.",
  "limitations": [
    "The first refreshed lanes used BinomExpansion c939… built from old source 256acd2a…; their affected outputs are historical. The selected six-module replays use source-current 9e5b13dc… built against adopted Pow a464….",
    "A source-graph traversal found Pow, CyclicWord and TilingBand absent from the six upstream modules while overlay paths changed; that does not establish every transitive object actually loaded. The wider project, Foundation and Mathlib closure remains cached.",
    "Four private declarations disappear. The qualified-name search covers tracked Lean/Python in the research area, not untracked files, other types, dynamic names or external consumers. Matching census reports do not establish proof-body or every persistent-extension equality.",
    "The initial Sandwich probe failed due to missing ModularCancellation, and provisional runs lack full pin receipts. Three independent audit setup attempts failed while adapting heterogeneous receipt schemas; their logs and the corrected postcommit audits are included.",
    "Paired shared-load timings are single samples, not a general performance benchmark. Some prior producer receipts record one source digest rather than a source-after hash.",
    "Compiled objects and cached overlay contents are omitted; receipts preserve their hashes and first-provider paths. Independent object byte checks need external objects."
  ],
  "archive": "inputs-and-logs.zip",
